{
  "type": "ai-phone-status-region",
  "version": 1,
  "contract": "【逻辑】\n在回复的最后，请根据当前情境输出角色的状态数据。要求包含两部分：\n1. 心理活动：当前内心的真实想法，必须限制在50字以内。\n2. 散文摘抄：当前情景下，想要写或摘抄给用户的一句文艺的散文。\n【格式】\n必须将以上内容用 [状态栏] 和 [/状态栏] 完整包裹，并严格按以下固定格式输出（不要添加额外说明）：\n[状态栏]\n心理活动：(填写50字以内的心理活动)\n散文摘抄：(填写一句散文)\n[/状态栏]",
  "renderHtml": "<style>\n  .ios-notes {\n    background: #ffffff;\n    border-radius: 16px;\n    padding: 16px 20px 24px;\n    box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);\n    font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", sans-serif;\n    position: relative;\n    overflow: hidden;\n    border: 1px solid #f0ebe1;\n  }\n  .content {\n    position: relative;\n    z-index: 2;\n    line-height: 28px;\n  }\n  .header {\n    color: #eab308;\n    font-size: 18px;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    margin-bottom: 16px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 6px;\n  }\n  .section {\n    margin-bottom: 16px;\n  }\n  .title {\n    font-size: 12px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    color: #a1a1aa;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n    margin-bottom: 4px;\n  }\n  .text {\n    color: #3f3f46;\n    font-size: 15px;\n  }\n  .quote {\n    font-family: \"Songti SC\", \"STSong\", \"KaiTi\", serif;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    color: #27272a;\n    background: rgba(234, 179, 8, 0.1);\n    padding: 8px 12px;\n    border-radius: 8px;\n    border-left: 3px solid #eab308;\n    display: inline-block;\n    line-height: 1.6;\n  }\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"ios-notes\">\n  <div class=\"content\">\n    <div class=\"header\">\n      <svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M11 4H4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h14a2 2 0 0 0 2-2v-7\"></path><path d=\"M18.5 2.5a2.121 2.121 0 0 1 3 3L12 15l-4 1 1-4 9.5-9.5z\"></path></svg>\n      备忘录\n    </div>\n    <div id=\"display\">\n      <!-- JS 插入内容 -->\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<script>\n  const raw = window.STATUS_RAW || \"\";\n  let text = raw.replace(/\\[\\/?状态栏\\]/g, \"\").trim();\n  \n  let thoughts = \"\";\n  let prose = \"\";\n\n  const lines = text.split('\\n');\n  for (let line of lines) {\n    if (line.includes('心理活动：')) {\n      thoughts = line.split('心理活动：')[1]?.trim() || '';\n    } else if (line.includes('散文摘抄：')) {\n      prose = line.split('散文摘抄：')[1]?.trim() || '';\n    }\n  }\n\n  let html = \"\";\n  if (thoughts) {\n    html += `<div class=\"section\"><div class=\"title\">Inner Thoughts</div><div class=\"text\">${thoughts}</div></div>`;\n  }\n  if (prose) {\n    html += `<div class=\"section\"><div class=\"title\">Prose</div><div class=\"quote\">${prose}</div></div>`;\n  }\n  \n  if (!html) {\n    html = `<div class=\"text\" style=\"color:#a1a1aa;\">暂无笔记...</div>`;\n  }\n\n  document.getElementById('display').innerHTML = html;\n</script>",
  "previewRaw": "[状态栏]\n心理活动：看着她认真的侧脸，突然觉得周围的喧嚣都安静了下来，只想就这样静静地看着她。\n散文摘抄：我会在每个有意义的时辰，远隔山海与你共存。\n[/状态栏]"
}